+    template term, and cross-chain features are zeroed by default (`multichain_mask`), which deletes
+    the dock. This function instead reuses the two projections the CONFIDENCE HEAD applies to a pose:
+    a 39-bin one-hot of the pairwise distance (3.25-52 A, 1.25 A steps) and the raw scalar distance.
+    Both were trained to be ADDED ONTO z_trunk -- the confidence head's starting pair rep is
+    z_trunk + z_init -- so they already speak the trunk's channel basis, undiluted, with the
+    inter-chain block intact.
