+    WHAT IS NOT GUARANTEED. The trunk's own pairformer blocks were never trained with such a term in
+    their input; only the confidence head's 4 blocks were. The encoder is in the right basis, the
+    consumer is off-distribution. `gain` exists so that can be swept rather than assumed, and
+    PROTENIX_POSE_Z_DEBUG reports |delta| against |z| so the magnitude is measured, not hoped for.
